  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="027fdb43-9bb0-5832-947f-30d149da0636" activityNameId="e8b78be7-c964-5a7c-a009-198fa0567b57" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rape oil, at oil mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rape oil, at oil mill
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg rape oil, respectively rape meal. The multioutput-process 'rape seeds, in oil mill' delivers the co-products 'rape oil, at oil mill' and 'rape meal, at oil mill'. Economic allocation with allocation factor of 74.3% to rape oil. Allocation is done according to carbon balance for CO2 emissions.;
UUID: 35fdeef8-9704-3896-b7af-96b581a98a9f
This process includes the transport of rape seeds to the mill, and the processing of the seeds to rape oil and rape meal. The oil extraction refers to the solvent extraction technique. System boundary is at the oil mill.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical oil mill designed for rape oil solvent extraction, with pre-pressing of rape seeds, European context.
Time period: Data from 1996 to 2003, current technology in the EU
Production volume: Approx. 8100 kt of rape seeds were processed to RME in 2005 in the EU
Sampling: Cross-checking of various literature sources from 1998 to 2006 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_35fdeef8-9704-3896-b7af-96b581a98a9f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
